  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae okorangeria Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nigo arenge omorisia bwe riicho, rituko erimo gakorisia riicho ria Jethiro oyio orenge ise biara na Omokuani o Midiani, akariraa gochia bosongo y’erooro, agaika magega ya Horebu, egetunwa egechenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo omomalaika bw’Omonene akamoorokera ase omogwekano bw’erisase ri’omorero riare gwoka korwa ase obogatagati bw’egetutu gete. Musa akarigereria, akarora ng’a nonya kiare gwoka, tikiare koyia keere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Musa agateeba, “Nigo ’ngoeta korwa moino ’ndore okorora oko kw’ogokumia, imanye naki egetutu eke getari koyia keere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omonene arooche ng’a Musa oikire ang’e arore, akamorangeria korwa ase egetutu ime, “Musa! Musa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa agaitaba ogoteeba, “Nao inde aa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akamoteebia, “Tobaisa goika ang’e nonya ng’ake. Rusia ebikoroto biao, ekiagera aase agwo oteneine naachenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akamoteebia, “Inche ninche Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiao, Nyasae o Aburaamu, Nyasae o Isaka, na Nyasae o Yakobo.” Erio Musa agatuba obosio bwaye, ekiagera nigo airogete komorigereria Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene akabora, “Amaene narorire emechando yabaanto baane abwo bakare Misiri; naigure buna bakweumia inse yamaboko y’Abamisiri abwo bakobachanda, na inche namanyire kegima obororo bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainche nigo naikire inse mbatoorie korwa ase amaboko ya Abamisiri, mbatiirie korwa ase ense eria ya Misiri, mbaire ase ense engiya engare, ense eichire namabeere nobooke, ense ya Abakanaani, na Abahiti, na Abaamori, na Abaperisi, na Abahivi, na Abayebusi bono genda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainde bono ekerero ki’Abaisraeli giaikire ase ’nde, naende narorire ogochandwa koria Abamisiri bakobachanda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ’ngogotoma inde ogende ase Farao orusie abanto baane Abaisraeli korwa ense ya Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Musa akamoteebia Nyasae, “Inche ninche ng’o, kogenda ase Farao ’ndusie Abaisraeli korwa ense ya Misiri?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akamoiraneria, “Inche nimbe amo naye. Aye noruisie Abaisraeli korwa Misiri erio moche monsasime inche Nyasae ase egetunwa eke, na eke nakio kerabe ekemanyererio asore ng’a ninche omonyene nagotoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Musa agateebia Nyasae, “Kondaimoke kogenda ase Abaisraeli na kobateebia: Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaino ontomire inche ase more, barabwo baramboria: Erieta riaye, nere ng’o? Inki ndabateebie?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akamoiraneria Musa, “INCHE NINCHE INDE BUNA INDE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Obateebie Abaisraeli buna oria okorokwa: INCHE ontomire ase more.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Nyasae akamoteebia Musa, “Goika obateebie Abaisraeli: Omonene bwe chisokoro chiaino, Nyasae o Aburaamu, Nyasae o Isaka, na boigo Nyasae o Yakobo ontomire ase more; erio nario erieta riane kare na kare; ase erio nigo ’ndabe ekeinyorio ekiare ase ekiare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda, osangererie abagaaka b’Abaisraeli, obateebie ng’a: Omonene bwe chisokoro chiaino, Nyasae o Aburaamu, na o Isaka, na o Yakobo nang’orokera, aganteebia ng’a mbateebie: Amaene, narorire aya Abamisiri bakobakorera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na igo narire eira ng’a nimbang’anyie korwa Misiri ase mogochandwa, na kobaira ase ense y’Abakaanani, na Abahiti, na Abaamori, na Abaperisi, na Abahivi, na Abayebusi, ense entenenku egoiteka amabeere na obooke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na abagaaka b’Abaisraeli inabaigwe amang’ana ao. Erio mogende, aye na abagaaka ba Abaisraeli, ase omorwoti o Misiri, momoteebie: Nyasae bw’Abaiberania, natoorokera; na bono twanchere togende orogendo rw’amatuko atato gochia ase erooro, erio toruere Omonene oito, ekeng’wanso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inche omonyene nimanyete ng’a omorwoti o Misiri takobaa ribaga mogende atabeetereirie nokoboko kwane gwe chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio inche nindambore okoboko kwane, ng’ake Abamisiri namaakwa aane yogokumia. Erio magega Omorwoti nabae ribaga mogende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimbae abanto baane ogwancherwa ase obosio bw’Abamisiri; ekero moragende, timokogenda more namaboko amasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omokungu asabe omogisangio oye, na omokungu onde bwensi omenyete nyomba mwaye, ebinto bie chifeta na ebie chitaabu amo ne chianga; mobibekere abana baino, abamura na abaiseke. Ase enchera eyio nero morasakore Abamisiri chinibo chiabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
